    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into a dark dungeon and face countless dangers to achieve freedom!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your heroine finds herself in the depths of a sinister labyrinth, where goblins and skeletons lurk around every corner.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1591020/extras/fb6283e33ef5bdc0bb8f401e1653c905.avif?t=1742542029\" data-has-big /></div> Her goal is simple yet deadly: conquer 20 unique dungeon floors, which grow larger and more challenging with each step. Enemies on higher levels become stronger, making the journey to the end a true test of skill. The final challenge awaits in the throne room\u2014a battle against the powerful dungeon boss.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1591020/extras/986c7ad9930aea5d87b03090c4bd5d53.poster.avif?t=1742542029\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1591020/extras/986c7ad9930aea5d87b03090c4bd5d53.webm?t=1742542029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1591020/extras/986c7ad9930aea5d87b03090c4bd5d53.mp4?t=1742542029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Victory will unlock the gates to freedom, revealing a breathtaking landscape that marks your triumphant success!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally generated levels:</strong> Every floor is unique, ensuring each playthrough feels fresh and unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic enemies:</strong> Goblins and skeletons will attack as soon as they spot you. Stay agile to evade their devious strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magical combat:</strong> Defeat foes, collect magic charges, and cast fireballs to clear your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic boss battle:</strong> The final test demands all your courage and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive atmosphere:</strong> Dive into dark, detailed dungeon interiors that pull you into the game's world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why Play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy intense battles, engaging dungeon exploration, and the sweet taste of triumph after overcoming tough challenges, this game is perfect for you. Each run is a new adventure, and defeating the boss will cement your own personal legend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1591020/extras/8e1fd83562a0fa2d286a53585c0bafd8.avif?t=1742542029\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t miss the chance to test your skills and escape the dark labyrinth! Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into a dark dungeon and face countless dangers to achieve freedom!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your heroine finds herself in the depths of a sinister labyrinth, where goblins and skeletons lurk around every corner.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1591020/extras/fb6283e33ef5bdc0bb8f401e1653c905.avif?t=1742542029\" data-has-big /></div> Her goal is simple yet deadly: conquer 20 unique dungeon floors, which grow larger and more challenging with each step. Enemies on higher levels become stronger, making the journey to the end a true test of skill. The final challenge awaits in the throne room\u2014a battle against the powerful dungeon boss.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1591020/extras/986c7ad9930aea5d87b03090c4bd5d53.poster.avif?t=1742542029\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1591020/extras/986c7ad9930aea5d87b03090c4bd5d53.webm?t=1742542029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1591020/extras/986c7ad9930aea5d87b03090c4bd5d53.mp4?t=1742542029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Victory will unlock the gates to freedom, revealing a breathtaking landscape that marks your triumphant success!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally generated levels:</strong> Every floor is unique, ensuring each playthrough feels fresh and unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic enemies:</strong> Goblins and skeletons will attack as soon as they spot you. Stay agile to evade their devious strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magical combat:</strong> Defeat foes, collect magic charges, and cast fireballs to clear your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic boss battle:</strong> The final test demands all your courage and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive atmosphere:</strong> Dive into dark, detailed dungeon interiors that pull you into the game's world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why Play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy intense battles, engaging dungeon exploration, and the sweet taste of triumph after overcoming tough challenges, this game is perfect for you. Each run is a new adventure, and defeating the boss will cement your own personal legend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1591020/extras/8e1fd83562a0fa2d286a53585c0bafd8.avif?t=1742542029\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t miss the chance to test your skills and escape the dark labyrinth! Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>",
